  <item>
    <title>Vol.14-你还能保持多少专注力？ADHD&amp;专注力的分享</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6734c53c43dc3a4387676953</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6734c53c43dc3a4387676953</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 14 Nov 2024 09:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<h2><strong><span>本期嘉宾@tiutiu@ryan@diodio</span></strong></h2><span></span><h2><strong><span>剪辑@tiutiu</span></strong></h2><span></span><h2><strong><span>封面@ryan</span></strong></h2><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>大家觉得自己在做事情时还能保留多少专注力？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>专注力=自控力吗？专注力与自控力的区别。</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>分心的来源（非病理性）：</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><blockquote><span>RYAN：手机界面/app等设计就是为了让人沉迷（举例支付宝/淘宝界面，短视频平台等）抢夺注意力，也就容易引起注意力碎片化，最后导致人们越来越沉迷在动动手指就能获得的快乐中。</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>tiutiu：工作消息：国内职场使用微信来作为工作软件，需要不断查看设备。FOMO（害怕错过）心理加剧分心；“幻振现象”与注意力分散；睡眠质量与专注力；手机类：碎片化阅读降低深度专注能力、信息过载与认知负担增加、即时奖励机制和上瘾效应。</span></blockquote><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>ADHD</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><blockquote><span>diodio的经历分享，在英国NHS就诊ADHD的过程。</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>如何去区分 ADHD 和普通专注力缺陷。</span></blockquote><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>保持专注力的途径：控制对电子设备的使用</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>YouTube 推荐视频：把智能机回归到老式手机<a data-url="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7jVb1lLniEw" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7jVb1lLniEw">www.youtube.com</a></span></li><span>  </span><li><span>Ryan ：</span><strong><span>为自己的心灵留一片空间</span></strong><span>。</span><br><span>欢迎大家持续关注并且提出意见以及在评论区互动。</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>【收听渠道】</span></p><span></span><p><span>小宇宙@飞行茶室</span></p><span></span><p><span>喜马拉雅@飞行茶室</span></p><span></span><p><span>APPLE PODCAST @ 飞行茶室Floating Tea House</span></p><span></span><p><span>网易云 @ 飞行茶室</span></p><span></span><p><span>⛺这里是FM飞行茶室，欢迎各位顺路拜访！</span></p><span></span><p><span>【联系方式】</span></p><span></span><p><a href="mailto:593925373@qq.com"><span>593925373@qq.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎大家关注我们每一期精心设计的封面喔~~~接投稿，接商务。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fp-iBdVq6wWbxz7ojYyvMIVfMb62.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
